msgid ""
"All of the above expressions can be JIT compiled (onto CPU) by using the "
"``jax.jit`` directive. Practically, this provides a wrap-around back to the "
"Python interface of the IDAKLU Solver, so is only provided to afford maximum "
"downstream compatibility (where JIT may be called outside of the user's "
"control)."
